{"id":"finche_","lemma":"finché","pos":"conj","rank":549,"glosses":["as long as, while"],"ipa":"/finˈke/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/00/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-finch%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vattene fuori finché puoi.","en":"Get out while you can.","words":[{"g":"shoo!"},{"g":"out, outside, outwards"},null,{"g":"can, could","l":"potere"}]},{"text":"Aspetta qui finché non torno.","en":"Wait here till I return.","words":[{"g":"to wait for","l":"aspettare"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to return","l":"tornare"}]},{"text":"Se ne vada fuori finché può.","en":"Get out while you can.","words":[{"g":"if"},{"g":"of it"},{"g":"to go","l":"andare"},{"g":"out, outside, outwards"},null,{"g":"can, could","l":"potere"}]},{"text":"Non mi importa finché sei felice.","en":"I don't care as long as you are happy.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"to be important","l":"importare"},null,{"g":"are","l":"essere"},{"g":"happy"}]},{"text":"So che dovrei farlo finché sei qua.","en":"I know that I should do that while you're here.","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"sapere"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to owe","l":"dovere"},null,null,{"g":"are","l":"essere"},{"g":"here"}]}]}